# Refined syntax (docs/language-refinement.md).
helloServer is project
helloServer purpose "A minimal HTTP server that answers one health route"
helloServer target console
helloServer version "0.1.0"
helloServer language refined 1
helloServer standardLibrary 1
helloServer allows listen net.tcp "127.0.0.1:8080"
helloServer allows readWrite net.connection none
helloServer requires none
helloServer includesModule server
helloServer entry server.main
